content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Frequency", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of frequency to talk about how often you do something. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use them to talk about daily routines or when you make promises to people. </p>Here is the order of the adverbs in terms of frequency:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Frequency\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"60-80%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sometimes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"50%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Rarely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I always eat breakfast in the morning.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He never acts like that in public.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to make it up to someone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make something better by doing something else", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How can I make it up to you after our terrible date?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to make promises.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to move forward", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move on; to progress", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's the only way to move forward.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to treat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to behave toward someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will always treat you well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "queen", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a woman that is treated extremely well; a woman of royalty", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll treat you like a queen.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to raise one's voice", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to yell; to shout", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll never raise my voice again.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "open", "type": "name"}, {"content": "honest; truthful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll be open and honest with you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "detail", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fact; piece of information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll text you the details later.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online or to the library and find a country that has a queen or king.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read about them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a paragraph about them (8-10 sentences). Include information about their name, where they live, what they wear, etc.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the information with your partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research a king or queen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write 8-10 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the information with my partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}